"smart_blocks:Latin - Semester 1/Latin Written Assessment - Planning.md#2 is the most accurate in translating '*quod*' as 'because', although #1's 'as' is also accurate. #3 entirely omits this. Whilst #2's inclusion of the word 'struggling' makes sense in context, it is not a literal translation. Either 'fight' or 'contend' is an acceptable translation of contendunt, however 'to be in conflict' is not; there is no form of '*possum*' to translate into 'they are', nor is there '*in*'.": {"path":null,"embeddings":{"TaylorAI/bge-micro-v2":{"vec":[-0.05628668,-0.03987816,0.0374562,-0.02191092,0.03507512,-0.07114901,-0.04342668,0.06033631,0.01900966,-0.01107117,-0.00287217,-0.1202874,-0.00323379,0.01090673,0.03095813,-0.03427485,-0.05586417,0.0016038,0.01885183,0.04856114,0.09980988,-0.02383631,0.07000238,-0.00269889,0.08080363,0.12481397,0.00150002,-0.00132741,-0.01831009,-0.21265301,-0.0148935,-0.00402808,-0.01424039,-0.03904692,-0.02606319,0.00695131,-0.02646784,-0.01467046,-0.01357073,0.01387979,0.01748088,0.0648629,0.02847853,-0.07013088,-0.00630714,-0.03706865,-0.01573932,0.01033996,-0.06534858,0.00263905,-0.03776976,0.03408585,0.03444527,-0.00879071,0.02858902,0.0575285,0.02802318,0.06565705,0.03372004,0.01614826,0.03272713,0.05560761,-0.24211438,0.07895232,-0.04453233,0.01248235,-0.00880542,-0.0062775,-0.03485264,0.06625355,-0.02310353,-0.04900228,0.01140916,0.1053047,0.05068003,-0.0169746,0.04536327,-0.01438961,0.04038688,-0.02003957,0.01379765,0.02828836,-0.05408145,-0.00408346,-0.03437186,-0.07733607,0.01404676,-0.00375535,0.06883715,-0.01396884,0.0099327,-0.08607385,0.00076257,0.0159484,0.01863718,-0.00700772,0.00337305,0.0526129,-0.04284033,0.1060582,0.00756228,0.01394599,0.04771126,0.02488005,0.06656971,-0.00917202,0.02032866,-0.02506555,-0.04888701,0.02261863,-0.05539058,-0.04521912,0.00082101,0.01481055,0.0264811,-0.01495005,0.14376184,-0.01227541,-0.02663053,0.02067461,-0.00727169,0.00583182,0.00692034,-0.0262366,0.06382319,-0.05998047,0.03116092,-0.03731